    <sys:String x:Key="RemoveKeepDataHint">Remove from list: Transmission forgets the torrent and its .torrent file. Downloaded files stay on the server.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="RemoveDeleteDataHint">Delete with data: also deletes the downloaded files on the server. This cannot be undone.</sys:String>
